    "A Calmer Settings Screen": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更简洁的设置界面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Never option for the keyboard session timeout, an in-app stop control for hot mic, and Base64 JSON support for custom transcription servers.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘会话超时新增「永不」选项，热麦新增应用内停止控件，自定义语音识别服务器支持 Base64 JSON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A SuperGrok or X Premium sign-in now covers xAI Speech-to-Text as well as Grok chat, so you can transcribe without an API key.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SuperGrok 或 X Premium 登录现在同时覆盖 xAI 语音转文本和 Grok 对话，因此无需 API 密钥也能语音识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A call, alarm, or Siri no longer costs you the audio, and a failed transcription keeps the recording so you can play it back and retry.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来电、闹钟或 Siri 不再导致录音丢失；语音识别失败时录音会被保留，你可以回放并重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dinner, a meeting, an appointment - anything happening at a set time is offered as a calendar event, while to-dos keep going to Reminders.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "晚餐、会议、预约——任何在特定时间发生的事都会被建议为日历事件，而待办事项仍会进入提醒事项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new preset turns VivaDicta into a voice-powered AI assistant. Speak a question — get a formatted answer.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增预设可将 VivaDicta 变成语音驱动的 AI 助手。说出问题——获得格式化的回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prompt that asks for anything other than a transcript - a summary, a translation - is what you will get back, and the rest of the app treats it as the transcript.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果提示词要求的不是语音识别文本——比如摘要或翻译——你得到的就会是那样，而应用其余部分仍会把它当作语音识别文本来处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A proper Czech QWERTZ layout with Czech-only callouts. A newly added language now switches itself on if you already use it in iOS.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整的捷克语 QWERTZ 布局，带捷克语专属提示。如果你在 iOS 中已使用某新增语言，它现在会自动启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recording is already in progress in VivaDicta. Stop it first, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VivaDicta 中已有一项录音正在进行。请先停止它，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
