            "value": "始终使用 iPhone 自带麦克风录音，即使已连接耳机。这样在口述时可让蓝牙耳机保持全品质音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Obsidian note is created for new transcriptions and appended to when an existing note name matches. Placeholders: %@. To instead append to a daily note, set the name to just {date}. Per-mode opt-out for auto-open is available in each mode's settings. The clipboard is overwritten each time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会为新语音识别内容创建一条 Obsidian 笔记，当已有笔记名称匹配时则追加。占位符：%@。若要改为追加到每日笔记，请将名称设置为仅 {date}。可在每个模式的设置中选择退出自动打开。每次都会覆盖剪贴板。"
          }
