    "Each transcription is added as an entry to the file, e.g. File name Daily/{date} collects a whole day in one note. %@ Entry placeholders: %@, plus {markdown} for the full export with variations. {text} is the final text, {original} the raw transcription. Entries carry hidden markers, so exporting the same note again updates its entry instead of adding a copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条语音识别内容都会作为一条条目添加到文件中，例如文件名 Daily/{date} 可将一整天收集到一条笔记中。%@ 条目占位符：%@，另加 {markdown} 表示包含变体的完整导出。{text} 是最终文本，{original} 是原始语音识别内容。条目带有隐藏标记，因此再次导出同一笔记时只会更新其条目，而不会新增副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
