    "One markdown file per name. Placeholders: %@. A / creates subfolders, e.g. Daily/{date}. .md is added if missing. With a name unique per note (the default includes seconds) every transcription gets its own file; exporting the same note again overwrites it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个名称一个 Markdown 文件。占位符：%@。输入 / 可创建子文件夹，例如 Daily/{date}。缺失时会自动添加 .md。若名称在每条笔记中唯一（默认包含秒），则每条语音识别内容都会有自己的文件；再次导出同一笔记会覆盖它。"
          }
        }
