    "Soniox transcription model v5 with human-parity accuracy across 60+ languages, reengineered speaker separation and better handling of numbers, dates and emails. Powers Live Translation - super-fast real-time speech-to-speech translation, ideal for lectures and workshops.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
