            "value": "流式语音识别不再只有 Soniox。Deepgram Nova 3、Deepgram Flux、ElevenLabs Scribe 和 Voxtral Realtime 也能边说话边语音识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming models now transcribe while you talk in the keyboard too, not just in the app, so your text is ready almost the moment you stop.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "流式模型现在不仅在应用内可用，在键盘中也能边说话边语音识别，因此你一停下文字就几乎就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streams audio to Soniox while you speak instead of uploading after you stop, so the transcript is essentially ready the moment you finish. Same 60+ language coverage as the async model. Falls back to the standard upload path if the connection drops.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话时即把音频流式发送到 Soniox，而不是说完再上传，因此你一停下语音识别几乎就绪。语言覆盖与异步模型相同，均为 60 多种。若连接中断，会回退到标准上传方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streams to Google while you speak instead of uploading after you stop, so the transcript is ready the moment you finish. 85+ languages with automatic detection. Trades speaker labels for latency; falls back to Gemini 3.5 Transcribe on upload.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话时即流式发送到 Google，而不是说完再上传，因此你一停下语音识别就绪。85 种以上语言，自动检测。以牺牲说话人标签换取低延迟；上传时回退到 Gemini 3.5 Transcribe。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strips hesitation sounds like \"uh\", \"um\", \"ähm\" from transcripts, matched to the transcript's language. Disable to keep them verbatim. Applies to all modes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从语音识别内容中移除“嗯”“呃”“啊”等犹豫词，并按语音识别语言匹配。停用后将原样保留。适用于所有模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strips trailing \".\" or \"...\" from transcripts so casual messages like \"Okay.\" don't read as cold. Applies to all modes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
