    },
    "The app version now shows at the bottom of Settings, and a round of polish across the app.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用版本号现在显示在设置底部，并进行了全应用范围的润色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The art of writing is the art of discovering what you believe. Every word you speak is a seed, and every thought refined becomes a garden of clarity and understanding.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写作的艺术，就是发现你所相信之物的艺术。你说的每一个字都是一粒种子，每一次深思熟虑都会生长成清晰与理解的花园。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The filter that removes phantom phrases from silence had become slightly too eager and could clip a short real phrase off the end. It is back at the length it was tuned for.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于从静音中移除幻听短语的过滤器变得过于激进，可能会把结尾一句很短的真实话语也切掉。现已恢复为调优时的长度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full chat completions endpoint URL.\nExample: https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
