    "What's New in": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the transcribed text is wrapped in <TRANSCRIPT> tags before being sent to the AI. Keep this on when using our prompt templates, as they reference the text using these tags.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，语音识别文本会在发送给 AI 之前被包裹在 <TRANSCRIPT> 标签中。使用我们的提示词模板时请保持开启，因为模板会通过这些标签引用文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, your instructions are combined with system instructions to improve transcription quality. Disable for full control over the AI prompt. Note: Spelling Corrections are always included when enabled in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，你的指令会与系统指令结合，以提高语音识别质量。停用后可完全掌控 AI 提示词。注意：只要在设置中启用了拼写更正，它始终会被包含。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the keyboard needs you to swipe back to finish dictating, a full-screen prompt now makes the next step obvious.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当键盘需要你滑动返回以完成口述时，全屏提示会让下一步更清晰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whisper models are hosted on Hugging Face, which is slow or unreachable in mainland China. Choose the mirror there to download faster. Parakeet models always use Hugging Face.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whisper 模型托管在 Hugging Face，在中国大陆访问缓慢或无法访问。建议使用七牛云下载，速度更快。Parakeet 模型始终使用 Hugging Face。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Never the microphone stays armed until you end the session below, which uses more battery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择“永不”时，麦克风会保持待命状态，直到你结束下方的会话，这会消耗更多电量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Soniox, Gladia, or Speechmatics selected, pick a target language in the new \"Translate to\" picker. Your transcription comes back already translated, no extra AI step needed.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
