    "Your own personal interpreter. Speak in one language and hear it in another in near real time. Plug in headphones, pick from 60+ languages, and adjust playback speed.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的私人翻译官。用一种语言说话，近乎实时地听到另一种语言的译文。插入耳机，从 60 多种语言中选择，并调整播放速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your speech is transcribed while you talk instead of being uploaded after you stop, so the text is ready almost the moment you finish.": {
